# L §4.2: add_business with "n = 0 is refused (RUN-ZERO): rolling a day is schedule's job".
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
input len: calendar

version v
  cite s
  governs 2026
  known 2025-12-01
  len = calendar(weekends [sat, sun])

ask q1: add_business(2026-03-02, 0, len)
=== expect
q1: refused: RUN-ZERO ...
  cut 2026-12-31
